{
  "_about": "Vertical slice missions: Cold Open -> M1.02 (game bible 03 §3.5-3.7, 18.1-18.2, 20.1-20.3). Each step runs its on_start actions, shows its objective, and completes on its event. Jump to any step with the console command 'ExoJump <step id>' or the launch option -ExoStep=<step id>.",
